WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.760
André!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.770
André, where are you?

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.300
That's odd...

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.530
He's the one who suggested we go for a ride.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.660
Just where could he have gone?

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:45.800
André!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.580
<i>Wait...</i>

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>Wait just a little longer, Oscar...</i>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.680
<i>My right eye is blurry right now...</i>

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.380
<i>It's the only eye that I can see out of...</i>

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.420
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.890
<i>It'll subside shortly.</i>

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.660
<i>I'll be with you as soon as I can see again.</i>

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.040
<i>Just a little longer... wait for me...</i>

