00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.010
episode

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.010
"Andre,

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.010
'

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.010
a Green Lemon"

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.100
What's the matter?

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.020
What is going on exactly?

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.900
The Dauphin has suddenly
fallen ill with a high fever!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.530
All the doctors of the court are
gathered in the Dauphin's quarters!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.150
Joseph, Mother is right here.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:13.760
Be strong!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.590
Joseph...! My Dauphin!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.680
Father... Father...

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.630
Father...

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.460
Joseph...!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.600
It's all right.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.170
You have nothing to worry about.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.400
Your father will be here shortly...
Very shortly...!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.320
God...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.490
He calls for His Majesty so forlornly.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.600
He spends most of his time with me every day.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.460
Yet he calls for His Majesty
for help, instead of me...

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.300
Please forgive me...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.600
Please forgive me for my sins...

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.200
If...

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.310
If my son's suffering is punishment
for the sins I've committed...

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.580
I'm willing to swear to you right now
that I'll never see Fersen again...!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.860
So please... So please...!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.610
Please forgive me!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.810
The Dauphin's fever subsided close to dawn.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.980
Lord Joseph's health tends
to be on the delicate side.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:54.230
I hope this incident doesn't have a lasting effect.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:54.930
Oscar.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.230
Will you practice swords with me?

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:01.010
I'm having trouble grasping proper depth
perception with just my right eye.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.740
If I can't use a sword when
I need to, I'll be in trouble.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.180
All right, leave everything to me.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:07.310
I'll drill it into you!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.210
Come on now. Get it together!

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.570
Well done! We have a winner!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.140
Fersen...!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.650
It's been a while, Oscar.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:36.100
Yes, it really has been awhile.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.770
We both report for duty at Versailles, but I'm
in the army and you're in the Royal Guards.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.610
We never seem to have an
opportunity to see each other.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.070
Yeah...

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.250
When did we last see each other?

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.020
Do you remember?

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:50.580
I wonder when it was?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.880
Well, anyhow, you seem well.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.620
I heard about you through the grapevine.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.560
The Black Knight incident, for instance.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.850
That was a flawed attempt.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.020
I wasn't able to find who the culprit was.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:21.690
Yeah, the world doesn't always
work as we want it to, does it?

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.730
Fersen.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.260
How are things with you?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.660
What have you been doing?

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:29.430
Me?

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.140
I have nothing notable to tell you.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:34.910
Nothing especially happy,
nor especially sad happened...

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.410
I see.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.710
Oh, right... Come to think of it,

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.020
I had a mysterious encounter
at a ball about a month ago.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.850
I met a lady who looked just like you.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.390
I hear she was a Countess from a foreign country.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.690
I only saw her once at that ball.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.350
She was nowhere to be found at all
the other balls I went to afterwards.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.050
Just as I thought. Oscar... It was you!

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.260
That Countess was you!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.500
No matter how hard you try and hide it,
reflexes can't be hidden.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.440
Oscar!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.990
Perhaps if I had known you were
a woman from the beginning...

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.710
Don't say anything, Fersen!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.950
You mustn't say anything to me...!

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:06.920
I've already come to terms with my feelings.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.840
There are two kinds of love in this world.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.080
A love filled with joy...

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.440
...and a love filled with agony...

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.550
No, Oscar.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.020
There is only one kind of love in this world.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.790
Only a love filled with agony!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:34.520
I somehow knew this day
would come eventually...

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:37.160
This is the end, Fersen.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.080
This is where we part ways.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.280
Don't ever forget this, Oscar.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.250
You have been my greatest friend.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:53.130
And I have done my very best to
be your greatest friend, as well.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.710
I won't forget it...
I never will...

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.120
Farewell and take care.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.170
<i>God...</i>

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.350
<i>Please bestow your grace upon Fersen...</i>

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:30.250
<i>and please bestow him a love
filled with joy someday...</i>

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:42.130
ai ga kurushimi nara

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:42.130
If to love is to suffer,

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:47.470
ikura demo kurushimou

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:47.470
I shall suffer any amount,

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:53.350
sore ga kimi no kokoro ni

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:53.350
until someday

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.860
Want me to help, Oscar?

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.940
<i>No, it's all right.</i>

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:59.150
itsuka todoku made

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:59.150
it reaches your heart.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:04.900
kimi wa hikari boku wa kage

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:04.900
You are the light, I am the shadow.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:11.070
hanarenarenai futari no kizuna

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:11.070
We share a bond that can never be broken.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:16.650
kurushimeba kurushimu hodo

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:16.650
As I suffer and suffer more,

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:23.340
ai wa ai wa fukamaru

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:23.340
my love, my love grows deeper.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.340
<i>Oscar...!</i>

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.410
<i>Help me...!</i>

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:00.140
...is more frightening than the enemy's bullets!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:03.550
Let's go, let's go! Off to battle I go!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:09.250
Because a giant brawl is a man's desire!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.350
So, Mireille...!

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:19.220
Your lips will have to wait for a while!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:19.180
Hey, young man!

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:21.590
What's wrong?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.900
You look pretty down.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:27.030
I'm Alain from the French Guards.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.830
{What do you say?
}Why don't you join in and sing with us?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:33.290
Let's go, let's go! Off to battle I go!

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.290
Sure! More the merrier!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:38.570
Because a giant brawl is a man's desire!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:35.410
Thanks.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.260
I'll join you guys then.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.880
So, Mireille...!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:49.380
Your lips will have to wait for a while!

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:54.080
...don't be a cheat...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.560
Today was the French Guards' payday.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.450
We're just letting off some steam.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.120
The ''French Guards'' has a nice ring to it,

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.590
but we're just the sons of bakers
and farmers gathered together.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.550
We're not like the Royal Guards with their noble
pedigree, nor officially part of the army.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.500
Our unit is just a bunch of troublemakers
thrown together.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.370
We do all the dangerous jobs.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.770
Right now, they're making us patrol
the dangerous streets of Paris.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.070
Oh, I should stop.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.940
I've just been complaining
about our job, haven't I?

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:23.940
Young man.

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.710
You should talk about your troubles.
It's the best thing to do!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:32.430
Well, all right then, if you can't talk,
all the more reason to drink!

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:36.420
Hey, wise guy!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.720
You pushed the bottle, didn't you?!

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:38.820
I didn't push anything!

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:39.990
No, I saw you push it!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.450
Hah! There they go!

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:44.910
Apologize, you bastard!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:45.490
Screw you!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:47.910
Take your ''Ah!'' and shove it!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:50.630
Hey, don't hold back, you two!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.000
Shall we throw in?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:53.970
Okay!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.710
Don't worry!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.800
This is one of the things we look forward to!

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:23.000
So long, Mireille...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.260
Don't be a cheat...

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.610
...because my fist... is more frightening...

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:33.120
...than the enemy's bullets!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.250
Let's go, let's go...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.250
Off to battle I go...

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.450
<i>Oscar.</i>

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.820
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.820
<i>No matter how much I drink and make merry,</i>

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:49.010
<i>my right eye is also going
to lose its light someday!</i>

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.580
<i>Oscar...</i>

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:01.080
<i>What pains me the most, above all else, is not being able to look upon you anymore!</i>

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:12.150
What happened to you, André?

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:13.660
Nanna was worried about you.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.220
What about yourself, Oscar?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.120
Can't sleep?

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.820
Hey, the fireplace is almost out.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:27.960
André.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.220
I'm going...

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.970
...to leave the Royal Guards.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:51.260
Oscar... What did you just say?

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.220
I would like to be relieved from my post as
Regiment Commander of the Royal Guards.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.170
I beg you, please relieve me
of my post, Lady Antoinette.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.110
Where is this coming from?!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.130
Explain...
Explain to me why, Oscar!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.240
As long as it's not the Royal Guards,

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:09.440
I am willing to serve in the Border
Guards or even in the Navy.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.100
I beg you!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.560
Explain to me why, Oscar!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:17.150
This is my, Oscar François'
first and last personal request.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.450
Please grant me this favor!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:23.320
Oscar, if you wish it, I'll order the rank
of General for you immediately.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.690
So, you must explain...

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.490
Tell me why you wish to leave the Royal Guards!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.530
Please forgive me.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:37.370
I cannot tell you my reasons,
but please believe my words.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:43.290
Even if I should leave the Royal Guards, my loyalty
to Lady Antoinette shall never change.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.550
Stubborn Oscar...

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.750
Very well.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.760
Let me think it over.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.650
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.220
I, Oscar, am grateful from the bottom of my heart.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.040
<i>Why, Oscar?</i>

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.640
<i>Why are you leaving the Royal Guards?</i>

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.440
<i>Is it because your separation from
Fersen was too much to bear?</i>

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:22.470
<i>Or is it because you wish to run away from
Lady Antoinette, who Fersen loves?</i>

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:27.590
<i>Run if you can. If it was as easy as running away,
Oscar, I would have ran from you long ago!</i>

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:39.320
<i>The more you struggle, the more I...</i>

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:40.350
<i>The more I...!</i>

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.490
André.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.820
Do you remember these scratch
marks on this the wall?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.870
Yeah, I remember.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.070
It was around the time when
I first came to this manor.

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.970
It's the scratch marks from
us measuring our height.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:04.460
That was 23 years ago.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.590
I didn't have a shadow of a doubt
that I was a boy back then.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:11.050
I still hadn't known what love
or falling in love meant.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.420
I was brought up as a man.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:20.980
There'd be nothing strange if I lived the
rest of my life, even more so, as a man.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.950
That's why I'm going to leave the Royal Guards.

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:25.070
Oscar...!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.120
I want to live as a man!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:29.160
Being a woman, these emotions...
I want to forget it all!

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.030
I want a mission that only a man could do!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.660
I couldn't care less if I were an infantry soldier!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:36.370
I want to carry a gun, cross the river
and fight the enemy!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:40.310
I want my days to be spent risking my life in
the line of duty, without love or romance!

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:42.640
I want to live more like a man!

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:47.280
I'm going to return to those days,
when I believed I was a boy.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:48.380
I swear, I will!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.480
Oscar!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:11.980
What's wrong, André?

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:14.690
No, nothing. Nothing is wrong.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.210
That's strange.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.700
I could have sworn you called my name.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.010
No...

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.410
I... didn't say anything.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.080
I see...

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.250
I guess it was just my imagination.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.260
André.

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.130
André.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.770
I heard you went to see Dr. Lanson earlier today?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.910
Ah, yeah. He really took care of
me when I injured my left eye,

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.730
so I brought him some flowers in thanks.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.280
I see. As long as that's all it was...

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.690
You've been acting strange lately,

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.700
so I thought you might have
become sick somewhere.

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:01.090
Oh, come on. Of course, I'm fine.

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:12.860
<i>So, when did your right eye
start to become blurry?</i>

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.660
<i>Yes, about a week ago.</i>

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.670
<i>I see...</i>

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:19.030
<i>Doctor, I'm really worried.</i>

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:22.230
<i>I can't help but worry that my right
eye will become blind, as well.</i>

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.440
<i>Could such a thing happen?</i>

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.400
<i>Well, I can't say for certain,</i>

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:30.650
<i>but after losing one eye, it seems there's a lot
of strain being put on your remaining eye.</i>

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.440
<i>Please tell me frankly, Doctor!</i>

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.990
<i>Well, um...</i>

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:40.450
There.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.330
André.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.560
If you have time to drink,
give me a hand and help me.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.680
Bring our Lady some tea.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.830
Yes, yes. Certainly, Ma'am.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:00.470
Thank you.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:12.810
Well, good night.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.480
André.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.590
In order to live more like a man,

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:20.760
I can't depend on you like this forever.

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:23.500
I don't know which unit I'll be assigned to yet,

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.990
but after I leave the Royal Guards,
you don't have to accompany me anymore.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.990
Do as you wish.

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:32.430
Firstly, I want to start out by being independent.

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:34.310
Good night.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.500
Oscar.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.250
Just let me say this.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.450
Whether it blooms red or blooms white,

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:43.220
a rose is a rose.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.890
A rose could never become a lilac.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:49.630
André!

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:52.350
Do you mean to tell me, a woman
will always be a woman?!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.820
Answer me, André!

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:03.520
Answer me!

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:05.330
Depending on your answer, I'll...!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.850
Let go, André!

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.470
Let go of me, André! I'll yell for someone!

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:35.530
Well...?

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:39.990
What are you going to do to me, André...?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.250
I'm sorry...

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:52.900
I swear to God, I'll never do
something like this again.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:05.680
A rose could never become a lilac...

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.370
Just as you, Oscar...

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:11.600
Could never stop being Oscar.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:17.760
The past 20 years, the only person
I saw and yearned for was you.

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.370
I love you...

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.970
No, I couldn't help but love you...

00:22:22.970 --> 00:22:24.530
Deeply, beyond compare...

